{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/857012-rich-thomas-the-rpg","id":857012,"title":"Rich Thomas the RPG","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-01T01:06:31-07:00","id":857012,"title":"Rich Thomas the RPG","content":"I was really excited about this project from last year's brochure, particularly:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brochure</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the first time Onyx Path will cave to fan demand, we have begun development of Rich Thomas the RPG. This is a unique product offering:<br /> <br /> (a) Simplified character generation: You can only be one character, Rich Thomas.<br /> (b) A rich setting. Rich Thomas is set in the &quot;Real World&quot;, Onyx Path's most popular trademark setting. Vast amounts of historical detail, spanning 13.7 billion years, help place Rich Thomas in context.<br /> (c) Adventure paths. &quot; Rich Thomas goes to GenCon&quot; is already at the redlines stage and we currently have an open call for &quot;Rich Thomas gets breakfast&quot;.<br /> (d) Industry leading names. Black Hat McFarland and Murray the Pug will be joint developing this, Murray's first RPG not developed behind the fa\u00e7ade of a human owner.<br /> (e) Crossover material. WoD's metaplot will be updated to reveal Rich Thomas as Charon, Caine and Gaia. For CoD we reveal a new merit:<br /> <br /> Merit: &quot; Sorry, that's not in 3rd Ed&quot;<br /> Prerequisite: Character has the &quot;I am Rich Thomas&quot; merit<br /> Effects: Any creature who attempts to used a supernatural ability on Rich Thomas gets promptly told &quot;Sorry we've decided to scrap that ability in 3rd Ed&quot;. The power automatically fails and the creature leaves the scene immediately due to embarrassment from their outdated power set.</div> </div> </div> </div>Any chance we could get an update?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}